{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118815","id":3562509021,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7UV5Ld","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118815.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118815","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118815/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118815/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118815/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/29795e4fad5007f6cadee064d142a9ee3b83c200","number":118815,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use the `canvas_items`/`expand` stretch mode/aspect by default for new projects","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This ensures 2D elements are always at a readable size regardless of window size or screen resolution. In the era of hiDPI displays being common, this is generally considered a better default for nearly all games (as opposed to non-game applications).\r\n\r\nThe new defaults match the [common use case scenarios](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html#common-use-case-scenarios) for desktop/mobile games. For pixel art[^1] and application use cases, I plan to open a proposal soon to cover *setting presets* that can be accessed in the project creation dialog to optimize for a certain use case (similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5658).\r\n\r\n[^1]: The current defaults are not really ideal for pixel art either, since the pixel art ends up being tiny as the window size increases.\r\n\r\nThe `expand` stretch aspect ensures there are no black bars when the window aspect ratio differs from the base aspect ratio (16:9 by default), which matches previous behavior under the `disabled` stretch mode.\r\n\r\nBehavior for controls that are not anchored correctly is overall slightly improved by these defaults: instead of floating somewhere in the middle of the screen, the controls will be at their expected location when the window aspect ratio is the same as the base aspect ratio. Regardless, both the previous and new defaults require the use of anchors for UIs to scale correctly across different aspect ratios.\r\n\r\nExisting projects are not affected by this change, as this only affects projects created after this commit is merged.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3939.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n*This test project uses 3 anchored labels at the top, and a top-left anchored label manually placed at the center (designed to mimic a scenario of a control that was not correctly anchored).*\r\n\r\n### 1152×648\r\n\r\n*Base window size.*\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260421_163641\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/804d171f-ceea-4ff5-a119-9723bad995ae\" />\r\n\r\n### 3840×2160\r\n\r\nOld | New\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260421_163645\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d27d830e-4d2b-41b2-b503-f668deafc431\" /> | <img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260421_163655\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72620e99-6a7a-40a4-b458-af4d4e644ec2\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akie